Privacy Policy

Effective Date: 11-Sep-2026
App Name: Labyrinth Maze Puzzle

Labyrinth Maze Puzzle respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how the app handles information when you use the iPhone and Apple Watch versions of the game.

Information We Do Not Collect

Labyrinth Maze Puzzle does not require you to create an account.

We do not collect, sell, rent, or share personal information such as your name, email address, phone number, contacts, photos, precise location, or browsing history.

We do not use third-party advertising trackers, and we do not track you across apps or websites owned by other companies.

Device Motion Data

The app uses device motion and orientation data from your iPhone or Apple Watch so you can control the steel ball by tilting your device.

This motion data is used only for gameplay and calibration. It is processed on your device and is not sent to our servers.

Game Progress and Settings

The app may store gameplay information locally on your device, including:

• Current level
• Completed levels
• Best times or scores
• Stars earned
• Gold bar balance
• Premium membership status
• Sound, haptic, calibration, and gameplay settings

This information is used to save your progress and improve your gameplay experience. It is stored locally using Apple system storage.

If you use both the iPhone and Apple Watch versions, some progress, currency, and premium status information may be shared between your own paired devices using Apple’s WatchConnectivity framework.

In-App Purchases

Labyrinth Maze Puzzle may offer in-app purchases, such as gold bars or premium membership.

Purchases are handled by Apple through the App Store. We do not receive or store your payment card number, billing details, or Apple ID password. Apple may process purchase information according to Apple’s own privacy policy and App Store terms.

App Store Reviews

The app may use Apple’s standard in-app review prompt. This is provided by Apple. We do not collect the text of any App Store review through the app.

Children’s Privacy

Labyrinth Maze Puzzle is designed as a general puzzle game and does not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided personal information to us, please contact us so we can address the issue.

Data Sharing

We do not sell personal data.

We do not share personal data with advertisers or data brokers.

Information related to purchases, downloads, crash reports, diagnostics, or App Store activity may be handled by Apple according to Apple’s own policies and settings.

Data Retention

Gameplay progress and settings remain on your device unless you delete the app, reset app data, or clear relevant device storage. Purchase entitlements may be restorable through Apple’s App Store systems.

Your Choices

You can manage or delete app data by deleting the app from your device. You can manage App Store purchase history, subscriptions, and Apple privacy settings through your Apple account and device settings.

Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted with a new effective date.

